# Bhutan ECCD (WSH + Haeru) — Cursor pointer

Strict rules live in **`.cursor/rules/*.mdc`** and **`AGENTS.md`**.

## Enterprise Score gate
Average ≥ 9.0 · no dimension &lt; 8 · critical (Theme/A11y, Privacy/ELDS, Frontend TS, Backend/Hermes) each ≥ 9. Paste scorecard when done.

## Quick MUST NOTs
- Bare `text-white` on frosted glass · `rotateX`/`rotateY` tilts
- Parent classroom feeds · caregiver seeing fees
- ELDS/Hermes to parents before Director confirm
- Secrets in the frontend · schema drift from `docs/hermes-observation-schema.json`

